{"v":1,"id":"bd13c6eb1e81","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"You will never know the stone cold grave,","s":34.31,"e":37.34},{"t":"nor hang from a criminal’s tree.","s":37.42,"e":42.86},{"t":"Never taste that severed breath","s":42.95,"e":45.8},{"t":"when heaven seemed far from Me.","s":45.86,"e":48.05},{"t":"You will never sweat out drops of blood","s":48.15,"e":54.65},{"t":"in a garden pressed alone.","s":54.73,"e":59.84},{"t":"Never hear brutes haggle your garments.","s":59.92,"e":63.26},{"t":"Hung bare, stripped down to bone.","s":63.32,"e":68.38},{"t":"As they pierced My side and lifted Me high,","s":68.46,"e":73.18},{"t":"arms opened wide between earth and sky…","s":73.28,"e":76.91},{"t":"I was brought down low in My passion.","s":76.99,"e":80.31},{"t":"I bore that hour to make you Mine.","s":80.43,"e":84.72},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":84.75,"e":86.84},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":86.94,"e":88.9},{"t":"Love does not turn away.","s":88.99,"e":93.22},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":93.32,"e":95.37},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":95.48,"e":97.46},{"t":"I bore the price that day.","s":97.58,"e":118.58},{"t":"I hope you never feel what I feel","s":118.66,"e":122.55},{"t":"when the earth is filled with violence.","s":122.59,"e":128.44},{"t":"When rivers of tears and blood run dry","s":128.51,"e":132.21},{"t":"and heaven answers silence.","s":132.31,"e":137.07},{"t":"My heart is very heavy.","s":137.15,"e":139.43},{"t":"I take no pleasure at all.","s":139.55,"e":145.0},{"t":"As My hand draws back in anger,","s":145.11,"e":148.74},{"t":"still My tears begin to fall.","s":148.83,"e":152.91},{"t":"My blood runs down - and they refuse it.","s":153.01,"e":157.26},{"t":"My tears fall like rain - yet they turn away.","s":157.34,"e":161.46},{"t":"They heap up death with willing hands.","s":161.51,"e":165.44},{"t":"Still they choose it.","s":165.48,"e":167.35},{"t":"They choose death.","s":167.38,"e":168.29},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":168.31,"e":172.13},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":172.23,"e":174.03},{"t":"Love does not delight in flame.","s":174.13,"e":178.35},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":178.46,"e":180.43},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":180.53,"e":182.49},{"t":"Yet still I am the same.","s":182.59,"e":187.61},{"t":"As they bruise Me and spit in My face,","s":187.63,"e":191.84},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":191.94,"e":196.17},{"t":"As they pierce My side,","s":196.22,"e":198.07},{"t":"blood and tears run down together.","s":198.11,"e":204.53},{"t":"As My own people drive in the nails,","s":204.63,"e":208.76},{"t":"I am lifted from My place,","s":208.88,"e":212.49},{"t":"arms spread apart, waiting still","s":212.59,"e":216.54},{"t":"to receive them in embrace.","s":216.66,"e":221.05},{"t":"Oh My people… why?","s":221.15,"e":225.34},{"t":"why have you forsaken Me?","s":225.38,"e":229.85},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":229.91,"e":234.1},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":234.18,"e":236.51},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":236.61,"e":242.55},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":242.63,"e":247.02},{"t":"Forsake Me?","s":247.1,"e":251.25},{"t":"Forsake Me?","s":251.33,"e":255.66},{"t":"This sorrow will not rise again.","s":255.68,"e":258.86},{"t":"This ruin must not remain.","s":258.89,"e":264.48},{"t":"Love will purge what love must purge","s":264.54,"e":268.88},{"t":"Death can not reign.","s":268.98,"e":271.65},{"t":"I take no pleasure in what must be done ,","s":271.76,"e":276.5},{"t":"no pleasure at all.","s":276.6,"e":281.19},{"t":"Evil will not toil forever.","s":281.28,"e":284.78},{"t":"Our tears will cease to fall.","s":284.88,"e":292.68},{"t":"fall","s":292.77,"e":296.81},{"t":"fall","s":296.91,"e":301.04},{"t":"fall","s":301.14,"e":304.81},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":304.84,"e":307.21},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":307.31,"e":309.2},{"t":"But not for endless years.","s":309.3,"e":313.27},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":313.38,"e":315.59},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":315.69,"e":317.89},{"t":"Purging sorrows and fears.","s":317.99,"e":321.97},{"t":"I am come down.","s":321.98,"e":325.79},{"t":"Not divided in My heart.","s":325.89,"e":330.57},{"t":"Love that bled for you","s":330.67,"e":334.07},{"t":"now takes man's kingdoms apart.","s":334.15,"e":339.02},{"t":"I AM.","s":339.1,"e":343.12},{"t":"I AM.","s":343.24,"e":347.35},{"t":"I AM come down!","s":347.47,"e":348.38},{"t":"down","s":348.41,"e":348.51},{"t":"down","s":348.61,"e":352.5},{"t":"down","s":352.59,"e":353.06}],"match":null}
